{"lastName": "Abdulhadi", "overview": "Dr. Abdulhadi is an endocrinologist who provides a wide array of clinical services including diabetes, thyroid, pituitary, adrenal, osteoporosis and obesity medicine. Dr. Abdulhadi sees patients daily at the Kirklin Clinic at UAB and at the Highlands Weight Loss Medicine Clinic. She completed fellowship training at the University of Alabama at Birmingham and Baylor College of Medicine in Houston, Texas. She was elected as a member of the prestigious Alpha Omega Alpha Honor Medical Society. She is board certified by the American Board of Endocrinology and the American Board of Internal Medicine. She also actively serves as a member of the Endocrine Society and the American Association of Clinical Endocrinologists.", "hasThumbnail": true, "discoveryUrlId": "17472-basma-abdulhadi", "positions": [{"fromInstitutionalAppointment": false, "position": "Assistant Professor", "department": "Medicine - Endocrinology, Diabetes, and Metabolism"}], "tags": {"explicit": [{"paths": [["Medical and Health Sciences"]], "valueAnalysed": ["Clinical Sciences", "Sciences"], "value": "Clinical Sciences"}, {"paths": [["Medical and Health Sciences"]], "valueAnalysed": ["Public Health and Health Services", "Health and Health Services", "and Health Services", "Health Services", "Services"], "value": "Public Health and Health Services"}, {"paths": [["Medical and Health Sciences"]], "valueAnalysed": ["Cardiorespiratory Medicine and Haematology", "Medicine and Haematology", "and Haematology", "Haematology"], "value": "Cardiorespiratory Medicine and Haematology"}]}, "discoveryId": "17472", "linkedObjectsCounts": {"grants": {"all": 0, "favourites": 0}, "teachingActivities": {"all": 0, "favourites": 0}, "equipment": {"all": 0, "favourites": 0}, "professionalActivities": {"all": 0, "favourites": 0}, "publications": {"all": 8, "favourites": 0}}, "firstName": "Basma", "firstNameLastName": "Basma Abdulhadi", "equipmentLinkTypes": [], "objectId": 17472, "updatedWhen